Data attribution: Crossref; Retraction Watch via Crossref; OpenAlex; Directory of Open Access Journals (DOAJ).
Journal Hub consolidates the former Emerging Journals 2026, Journal Trust Profile, OA & APC Explorer, Abstract Journal Matcher and Journal Timing interfaces without copying their large data assets.
Publishing Toolkit consolidates the former Reference Checker and Identifier Toolkit interfaces while retaining their local parsing and validation modules.
Journal Timing includes aggregate Crossref metadata and DOAJ CC0 journal metadata; article-level build responses are excluded.
SCImago is linked as an external ISSN lookup only; no SCImago or Scopus-derived values are distributed.
The OA & APC Explorer contains no OpenAPC data; it links to OpenAPC only as a separate resource.
