Plant Lab Toolkit — original calculation code by Shoaib Munir.
Published formula sources and the integrated dilution, qPCR, sequence, GC-content and primer-Tm methods are documented in tools/plant-lab-calculators/METHODS.md. The three former standalone plant-lab URLs are redirect stubs; their implementations were consolidated into Plant Lab Toolkit.
No Primer3 or other third-party calculation code is included.

Dilution Calculator, qPCR ΔΔCt Calculator, Reverse Complement, Descriptive Statistics,
and Journal Figure Resizer contain original browser-only code. Their methods and limits
are documented in the corresponding tools/<slug>/METHODS.md files.
